cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Calcium Imaging Cell Sorter: a desktop GUI for reviewing cells in Inscopix calcium-imaging data"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Calcium Imaging Cell Sorter is a small desktop GUI for reviewing the cells
  identified in Inscopix calcium-imaging recordings. It opens one or more
  cellset .isxd files with their matching max-dF/F image and shows each cell's
  image, its outline on the max-dF/F image and its calcium trace. Each cell can
  be accepted, rejected or left undecided, and the decisions are saved to a CSV
  file and, on request, written back into the .isxd files. Before a review
  starts, it checks that the cellsets contain the same cells and share the
  field of view of the max-dF/F image.
